# Build context hygiene (docs/planning/PENDING_CONTAINERISATION_PLAN.md §3):
# the Go builds need none of these, and excluding them shrinks the context
# from GBs to MBs. Version info arrives via build args, not .git.
.git
.devnet
.claude
# NB: docs/ stays in the context — docs/docs.go is a Go package the app
# imports (it embeds static/openapi.yml)
docs/planning
**/*.log
coverage.out
coverage.html
dist
Dockerfile
devnet/docker/Dockerfile.tools
